  <item nodeId="node-1048">
    <command xml:space="preserve">The PI's Actual Interrogation</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">The PI's Actual Interrogation&#x000A;An Interactive Fiction by nico ailani carlson&#x000A;Release 1 / Serial number 251002 / Inform 7 v10.1.2 / D&#x000A;&#x000A;Interrogation Room&#x000A;Yes, this is actually an old storage closet in an abandoned warehouse but to you, it is an interrogation room. Sitting in front of you is Perry, your prime suspect in the case. Perry is "innocent", according to Perry. Sure, Perry. Isn't everyone?&#x000A;&#x000A;You can see Perry, a box (closed), a blue ball and a green ball here.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
