  <item nodeId="node-1106">
    <command xml:space="preserve">ask perry about murder weapon</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You ask Perry about the murder weapon, the beat up old knife that was found at the scene, covered in blood.&#x000A;&#x000A;"Murder weapon? Knife? I swear to God, Man. I don't know what you're talking about. Are you some kind of cop? Don't I have rights?&#x000A;&#x000A;Not as a criminal in the US of A, old boy. And that's actually true. Modern slavery exists in the US prison industrial complex.&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
  </item>
